{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/c53a1d1f4eac241c2a9a507356d84586.avif?t=1765893039\" width=1560 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Final Knight is a strategy-driven action RPG inspired by the world of Dungeons &amp; Dragons.</strong><br>In a classic fantasy setting, players form a party using a wide range of weapons, spells, artifacts, and items to face massive bosses that threaten the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/1128757122e22c3d66813f826474507d.poster.avif?t=1765893039\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/1128757122e22c3d66813f826474507d.webm?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/1128757122e22c3d66813f826474507d.mp4?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Combat</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of your directly controlled character, allies act automatically.<br>Take advantage of the <strong>Tactical Command (time-stop) system</strong>, inspired by CRPGs, to pause the battle and issue orders with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between characters in real time\u2014taunt enemies as the Warrior, unleash Meteor as the Wizard, perform a Backstep as the Rogue, or cast healing spells as the Cleric\u2014chaining them together into powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/d0b99d521e1dfed3aef9bdac6d715a63.poster.avif?t=1765893039\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/d0b99d521e1dfed3aef9bdac6d715a63.webm?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/d0b99d521e1dfed3aef9bdac6d715a63.mp4?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Party Building</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>4 characters out of 9 distinct classes</strong> to form your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class fulfills a fundamental role\u2014Tank, Damage Dealer, or Support\u2014and can further specialize through leveling, advanced job changes, and stat growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>unique feats from equipment</strong> and the <strong>Formation system</strong> that alters party positioning, you can craft and execute your own strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/57e562b6ec85db74e2aa55f1e307426d.poster.avif?t=1765893039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/57e562b6ec85db74e2aa55f1e307426d.webm?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/57e562b6ec85db74e2aa55f1e307426d.mp4?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Growth Paths</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every party member can progress in multiple ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced job changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking unique feats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastery upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting and fusing equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear enhancement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discovering bonds between characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team evolves endlessly along the paths you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/53d2c29df2e086797752ad4ff6f0cf81.avif?t=1765893039\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Endless Gameplay Loop</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on raid-style battles against powerful bosses.<br>Break their weak points, harvest materials, and forge new equipment.<br>When enemies are staggered, unleash devastating combos by combining strategy with precise controls to bring them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/b62e92b6cce253638caf1a2984ce05cf.poster.avif?t=1765893039\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/b62e92b6cce253638caf1a2984ce05cf.webm?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072980/extras/b62e92b6cce253638caf1a2984ce05cf.mp4?t=1765893039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Play <strong>offline 2-player co-op</strong>, experiment with skill synergies, and discover new ways to combine abilities with a friend.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Now the real fight begins!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/eea880138bc157952b9e376b1b6527093587e559.jpg"},{"name":"War Machine? Just a pile of scrap.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/bb63f6dd55ba5292e29f4fe9c631a257cf077c0a.jpg"},{"name":"Even the ogre couldn\u2019t escape in the end.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/1d37e2cd92e58c00cc076a68ed3a2d1f7d8874c9.jpg"},{"name":"I finished it before the drake could even spread its wings!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/e9e8f55b6532f7935c4b1a7e19a196826fdb6f1c.jpg"},{"name":"Skull King? Just a big pile of bones.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/e66d9e355a0f09a9259e92d0a20de38dbe5c8cff.jpg"},{"name":"The King of Stuns, the Fear of Monsters!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/4da4f73727daf9d995faa137d54a0e8c70088e18.jpg"},{"name":"I am the God of Critical Hits.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/c96d6054bd91cbe76ba38ca1d9859b792796dc27.jpg"},{"name":"Who\u2019s the strongest?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/9ba197773ad89577a09e8f8db145b20518fa30e3.jpg"},{"name":"300% damage limit break! This isn\u2019t science, it\u2019s art.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2072980/090edd85e90f7acb34c0229256c71283c9564ef2.jpg"},{"name":"The Bear is Under My Feet Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam